recommend keep-going judge_outcome is the head at four hundred and sixty-eight and its thirty-seven widenings all bind carry, a module the harness already imports; read the twenty-six declarations that differ from the thirty-seven before lifting, since two consecutive laps have now found a differing body to be structural rather than drift, and this is the largest divergent cohort the arc has met
